{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Piece by Piece</i> is a <i>literal</i> puzzle-platformer where each level is fragmented into jigsaw pieces.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 100 handcrafted levels across 12 puzzle box, Piece by Piece will test even the most hardcore of puzzle solvers with new types of puzzle pieces that combine in puzzles the deeper you get. A cozy art style and an ethereal soundtrack keep you in flow as you solve your way through each puzzle box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.poster.avif?t=1773671551\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.webm?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.mp4?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12 Puzzle Boxes. 100 Puzzles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 12 puzzle boxes that introduce a new theme and mechanic that changes the way you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.poster.avif?t=1773671551\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.webm?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.mp4?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 clas